==Galician==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|gl|lampar}}

===Etymology===
Attested since circa 1750. From {{der|gl|gem-pro|*lapjaną||to lick; lap}} (compare {{cog|enm|lappen}}, {{cog|goh|laffen}}, {{cog|fr|lamper}}). Compare with {{l|gl|lamber||to lick}}, which derives of Latin {{m|la|lambo|lambere|lick}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|gl|/laˈpaɾ/}}

===Verb===
{{gl-verb}}

# to [[lick]], to [[lap]]
# to [[quaff]], to [[swig]]
# to [[slurp]]; to [[eat]] disorderly or compulsively
#* {{quote-text|gl|year=1807|author=anonymous|title=Segundo diálogo dos esterqueiros
|passage=''é estou en que na quel dia / vos '''laparon''' todo aquelo / que non poideron vender / como quen vos toma a parva''
|translation=I have the idea that that day they '''slurped''' everything that couldn't sell, as if having a snack}}
# {{lb|gl|figurative}} to [[rob]]

